OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment fights whistleblower
OL,4,Avideo
OL,5,
OL,6,FGovernment lawyers have appealed
OL,7,Fagainst a judge's decision to allow a
OL,8,Fvideo of a meeting of a safeguarding
OL,9,Fgroup to be played during an employment
OL,10,Ftribunal.
OL,12,FAlison Renouf was dismissed from her
OL,13,Frole as a social worker with the States
OL,14,FEmployment Board (SEB) after she shared
OL,15,Fthe video with Family Nursing and Home
OL,16,FCare and the National Society for the
OL,17,FPrevention of Cruelty to Children.
OL,19,FHaving brought an unfair dismissal
OL,20,Fclaim, Renouf argued she shared the
OL,21,Fvideo in an effort to protect children.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
